  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186096700,
      "id": "dc5bab6c-1ce7-58b5-a59d-cff2ce35ecca",
      "title": "Identifying Parallel Vectors From a Diagram"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "89144ac3-58cf-5d4b-b192-50b957305dd1",
      ":question/problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/generate/scratch/17592186096700/plots/6d9b1a6e6499a466698f2a8f060e327643fd3dbd8c74db3c9df11d07b7b2f645.png)\n\nConsider the diagram that is shown above. Which of the following statements are true?\n\n1. $a =-c$\n2. $c =-\\frac{1}{2}a$\n3. $b = d$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "ddea0be4-ff2a-59e0-985f-dbb761d390dd",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "f9ba9bbc-e29d-523d-ba0a-3d49d39e8a7a",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "5d79754a-c739-58a3-a0c2-63392b2dae0d",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "33cc7599-91b5-5bc7-a887-ec479556eaab",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "b2a9529b-a0d7-5c87-8b4f-8d17387a0143",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "76735e15-d6b2-5a18-b872-bbf795744e55",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II only"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "b2a9529b-a0d7-5c87-8b4f-8d17387a0143"
          ]
        }
      ],
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- Statement I is false. The magnitude of $a$ is $2$ times the magnitude of $c$. So, $a\\neq-c$.\n- Statement II is false. The vectors $c$ and $a$ have the same direction. So, $c\\neq-\\frac{1}{2}a$.\n- Statement III is true. Indeed, vectors $d$ and $b$ are parallel and have the same direction. Also, the magnitude of $b$ is $1$ times the magnitude of $d$. So, $b=d$.\n\nTherefore, only statement III is true."
    },
